This repository is a Lean 4 skeleton of pointwise algebraic identities
for a symmetric, trace-free 3×3 strain tensor, together with a short
note. It is not a solution of the Clay Millennium Navier–Stokes problem.
A successful Lean kernel check is not a PDE proof or a physical proof,
and it does not establish integrability of ‖S‖_∞ or Hypothesis B.
